WEBVTT

00:06.750 --> 00:11.090
<i>Ferry Crossing.</i>

00:14.130 --> 00:16.090
Ferry isn't running tonight.

00:17.180 --> 00:19.600
I guess I can't expect to
cross the river any time soon.

00:28.770 --> 00:30.450
I guess I'll stay here tonight.

00:30.480 --> 00:32.240
You sure love to get laid.

00:34.610 --> 00:37.590
Samurai, stay with me tonight.

00:37.620 --> 00:41.580
It'll rain all night. Why
don't you stay and relax?

02:28.770 --> 02:35.650
<i>Episode 6 Shelter from the Rain.</i>

03:29.790 --> 03:32.500
I see that you are quick.

03:33.630 --> 03:36.340
Unbefitting with your looks,
your shakuhachi sounded great.

03:37.050 --> 03:39.210
Give me the Sacred Dragon Stone.

03:39.800 --> 03:42.800
Unfortunately, I
don't give gifts to men.

03:43.640 --> 03:46.930
Then I will kill you
and take it away!

04:43.280 --> 04:48.240
Damn, those bandages
must have been poisonous.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.720
HeHo, heHo?

05:04.170 --> 05:05.170
Hello?

05:08.550 --> 05:10.470
Hello, sir?

06:16.500 --> 06:18.500
Takuma, what is it?

06:21.670 --> 06:24.470
Please excuse us.
We are travelers.

06:24.500 --> 06:28.010
We came into this mansion without
permission because of this pouring rain.

06:28.550 --> 06:29.630
Don't worry about it.

06:30.260 --> 06:33.310
I'm a traveler taking
shelter as well.

06:37.520 --> 06:39.520
Are you all right?

06:39.980 --> 06:42.200
I'll be fine with some sleep.

06:42.230 --> 06:43.820
A terrible fever.

06:44.440 --> 06:45.700
Takuma, fetch the medicine box.

06:45.730 --> 06:47.650
Yes, mother!

06:51.530 --> 06:53.410
You were poisoned.

06:54.030 --> 06:55.240
Stay still!

07:00.290 --> 07:01.830
Mother, here's the antidote.

07:02.330 --> 07:04.640
- Takuma, the water.
- Yes.

07:04.670 --> 07:05.810
Quit it.

07:05.840 --> 07:07.350
Leave me alone.

07:07.380 --> 07:08.720
Don't get involved with me!

07:10.630 --> 07:13.220
You should accept
the kindness of others.

07:14.010 --> 07:20.020
We too have been helped by many
people through our long journey.

07:21.900 --> 07:24.190
Please take this.

07:29.280 --> 07:32.110
It would be best to
stay still for a while.

07:32.660 --> 07:36.500
Takuma, find a dry spot
and make a bed for him.

07:36.530 --> 07:37.710
Yes.

07:37.740 --> 07:40.010
Come, to the back room.

07:40.040 --> 07:41.260
Thanks.

07:41.290 --> 07:43.960
We all help one another
when we are in trouble.

07:53.590 --> 07:56.360
I wish we had a change
of clothes for you.

07:56.390 --> 08:00.730
No need. If eel much
better thanks to you.

08:01.850 --> 08:04.730
Putting on a bold front.

08:07.400 --> 08:10.440
Are just the two of
you traveling alone?

08:11.110 --> 08:13.240
It's been two years already.

08:14.070 --> 08:16.740
Seems like you have
a long story behind it.

08:23.710 --> 08:26.380
- Man, it's raining cats and dogs.
- Sure is.

08:26.790 --> 08:28.210
We'll have to rest here.

08:30.010 --> 08:33.470
Oh, didn't know there
were guests here already.

08:34.010 --> 08:35.010
He's sick?

08:35.390 --> 08:38.690
Yes, a bit feverish.

08:38.720 --> 08:42.230
That's too bad.

08:42.640 --> 08:46.280
With rain coming down like
this, I guess it's easy to get sick.

08:46.310 --> 08:50.410
I sure am glad we
found a shelter for now.

08:50.440 --> 08:53.000
Do you all know each other?

08:53.030 --> 08:59.250
No, with this rain, the ferry was
cancelled and the lodges were all full.

08:59.280 --> 09:04.870
All of us were in a bind, and then
we found this abandoned mansion.

09:08.880 --> 09:12.520
As the saying goes,
it's not where you go,

09:12.550 --> 09:16.400
but with whom you
travel that really counts.

09:16.430 --> 09:19.230
So, how about a drink, everyone?

09:19.260 --> 09:22.020
I'd sure welcome a drink!

09:22.100 --> 09:24.570
I love sake more
than anything else.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.160
You over there, please join us.

09:26.190 --> 09:28.350
Oh, please forgive me.

09:28.900 --> 09:32.360
For a young man, how
about some candies?

09:34.070 --> 09:38.110
Here, these are lovely.

09:54.800 --> 09:56.380
What's that?!

10:02.100 --> 10:05.390
Get out... quickly, get out!

10:08.560 --> 10:11.520
This guy doesn't
have anything inside.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.300
<i>This sword technique.</i>

10:38.090 --> 10:41.640
You'd rather die an easier death
than to suffer through the poison.

10:42.010 --> 10:43.220
Step back!

11:00.110 --> 11:01.570
H-Hey...!?

11:28.850 --> 11:30.030
Keep away!

11:30.060 --> 11:31.910
Both of you, get
out of here now!

11:31.940 --> 11:36.540
As you saw, you get nothing but
trouble hanging around with me.

11:36.570 --> 11:39.610
I cannot leave an
ill man by himself.

11:42.030 --> 11:45.380
Come, let's go to the back.

11:45.410 --> 11:47.120
Takuma, help me out here.

11:47.540 --> 11:50.500
Y-Yes, mother...

12:33.290 --> 12:36.330
Come, this is a fever reducer.

12:39.800 --> 12:40.840
Thanks.

12:50.100 --> 12:51.600
What is it?

12:52.270 --> 12:53.660
Not now, thanks.

12:53.690 --> 12:54.690
But—.

12:55.060 --> 12:57.860
Is revenge the
purpose of your travel?

12:59.440 --> 13:02.360
Why would you think that?

13:03.650 --> 13:09.500
To take a young child
and travel for two years...

13:09.530 --> 13:11.580
It's not that hard
to figure out.

13:13.580 --> 13:15.330
You're right.

13:16.210 --> 13:20.270
Two years ago, after my
husband was slain by someone,

13:20.300 --> 13:24.970
I was let go from the clan,
being told to avenge my husband.

13:26.090 --> 13:28.270
If I succeed in avenging
my husband and return,

13:28.300 --> 13:30.930
then my son will have a
future to become an officer.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.320
That is an unreasonable task.

13:33.350 --> 13:37.690
But that is the
way of the samurai.

13:38.520 --> 13:43.360
At that time, he was only
eight, and I needed some help.

13:44.400 --> 13:47.540
At first, we were with
my husband's retainers.

13:47.570 --> 13:52.420
But as time went by, the
retainers left one by one.

13:52.450 --> 13:55.590
In the end, there
were only the two of us.

13:55.620 --> 13:57.420
Bunch of heartless guys.

13:58.170 --> 14:00.310
I can't blame them.

14:00.340 --> 14:07.100
Thus I needed to learn ways to
take revenge with my own hands.

14:07.130 --> 14:11.850
So that's why you
tried to poison me.

14:22.440 --> 14:25.360
Mother, then, he is the one!

14:25.690 --> 14:28.610
The only clue I had of
my husband's killer was

14:28.640 --> 14:31.460
his exceptional skill
for drawing his sword.

14:31.490 --> 14:37.370
I continuously traveled looking for people
known for a quick-draw sword technique...

14:38.210 --> 14:40.920
and finally I have found
you, Mr. Jubei Kibagami.

14:41.330 --> 14:42.460
It must be someone else.

14:43.090 --> 14:47.380
No, I knew it was you, looking
at the way you swung your sword.

14:48.170 --> 14:51.810
Excellent cuts on
your opponents.

14:51.840 --> 14:55.470
They were exactly like
the one on my husband.

15:01.150 --> 15:02.530
Don't move.

15:02.560 --> 15:05.270
If you do, you'll
be torn to pieces.

15:05.780 --> 15:08.030
YOU over-nurse me.

15:10.070 --> 15:15.620
As I said before, I acquired some knowledge
to take revenge with my own hands.

15:16.370 --> 15:19.380
I am easily capable
of a technique like this.

15:19.410 --> 15:23.630
But can you tell me why
you killed my husband?

15:24.630 --> 15:29.390
Even if it was I who killed your
husband, unfortunately, I don't remember.

15:29.420 --> 15:33.390
I've killed so many that
I just can't keep count.

15:34.010 --> 15:37.320
At Hikawa village in Joshu,
two years ago on a summer night!

15:37.350 --> 15:39.360
I won't let you say
you've forgotten about it!

15:39.390 --> 15:40.730
You murderer!

15:48.110 --> 15:49.650
Come to think of it...

15:50.490 --> 15:52.880
I remember a samurai accused
me that my sheath touched him...

15:52.910 --> 15:55.160
or something like that.

15:56.280 --> 15:58.700
Was that all?

15:59.290 --> 16:05.130
That was good enough for folks
who call themselves samurai.

16:17.470 --> 16:18.760
Mother!

16:56.760 --> 16:57.730
Taku ma!

16:57.760 --> 16:59.400
You protect the kid!

16:59.430 --> 17:01.020
He'll be back soon!

17:34.090 --> 17:35.090
Mother!

17:35.550 --> 17:36.650
Hold on!

17:36.680 --> 17:38.760
Please hold on, Mother!

17:40.260 --> 17:42.770
Master Jubei...

17:43.520 --> 17:44.810
Takuma...

17:45.480 --> 17:48.230
Please save Takuma's life.

17:49.230 --> 17:51.230
Mother!

17:54.280 --> 17:55.280
Come!

17:55.610 --> 18:00.910
Mother! Mother!!

18:29.150 --> 18:31.150
- Takuma.
- Stay back!

18:37.450 --> 18:38.210
Mother.

18:38.240 --> 18:40.450
No, she's not. Look carefully.

18:45.120 --> 18:47.080
That thing is nesting inside.

18:50.000 --> 18:52.500
Humans are so pitiful.

18:55.340 --> 19:00.350
If you lose this bag, you all
become simply meat and bones.

19:00.380 --> 19:01.610
Bag?

19:01.640 --> 19:03.860
Am I not right?

19:03.890 --> 19:06.740
This face, torso, arms.

19:06.770 --> 19:09.780
The skin that covers
the entire body,

19:09.810 --> 19:11.100
I refer to it as the bag.

19:11.940 --> 19:14.450
I don't have a bag,

19:14.480 --> 19:17.940
but I have gained the power to
change myself to whatever shape I want.

19:18.610 --> 19:22.080
There's no need to be
cramped with meat and bones.

19:22.110 --> 19:27.670
It doesn't hurt me at all no matter
how many times you cut into the bags.

19:27.700 --> 19:30.620
I simply need to replace
them with a new one.

19:32.120 --> 19:33.890
You have no chance of winning!

19:33.920 --> 19:35.420
Is that so?

19:39.920 --> 19:41.380
Too bad!

19:43.140 --> 19:44.180
Mother.

19:47.060 --> 19:48.390
What!?

19:48.640 --> 19:50.780
Shit! Why?

19:50.810 --> 19:53.400
Why isn't it moving!?

19:54.060 --> 19:57.480
People aren't simply
creatures in a bag.

19:58.110 --> 20:02.110
You may not get it, but people
have something called a heart.

20:02.450 --> 20:03.250
What?

20:03.280 --> 20:05.830
What do you think
you're doing? Stop it!

20:08.700 --> 20:10.580
<i>Takuma...</i>

20:12.250 --> 20:16.420
<i>You've followed me
through this journey.</i>

20:17.420 --> 20:23.090
<i>From now on, you should live
strong and full with your own will.</i>

20:23.880 --> 20:26.720
Mother!

21:04.590 --> 21:05.680
Mother.

21:09.810 --> 21:12.350
Now what are you going to do?

21:13.430 --> 21:17.350
It's up to you to chase me all
your life to avenge your father.

21:19.770 --> 21:22.360
Takuma, you make
your own choice.

21:24.360 --> 21:25.650
I will...

21:28.530 --> 21:29.780
live on strong.

21:32.200 --> 21:34.300
Where will you go?

21:34.330 --> 21:36.930
Well, I don't know.

21:36.960 --> 21:41.090
Listen, you'll always have to make
choices if you want to live freely.

21:42.380 --> 21:44.090
Farewell.

21:44.760 --> 21:46.260
Master Jubei!

21:50.220 --> 21:52.100
Master Jubei...

23:29.570 --> 23:31.570
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:33.120 --> 23:35.410
The Hiruko ninja
still pursue the Stone.

23:35.910 --> 23:40.250
However, they also wish
to protect the Light Maiden.

23:41.000 --> 23:45.250
The kunoichi Azami,
adorned in bark, fights alone.

23:46.000 --> 23:49.630
Her devotion to her cause
shows even through blood.

23:50.170 --> 23:52.720
Finally, Jubei begins
the journey home.

23:53.180 --> 23:55.970
Next time on Ninja
Scroll: Blossom.

23:56.600 --> 23:57.900
<i>Episode 7 Blossom Witness.</i>

23:57.930 --> 24:01.310
<i>Episode 7 Blossom</i>
